From 07e866610e9872eb863b3de804d6a9f4797d21dc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 15:25:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] docs: apply the six independent-check fixes to the b10680
 kernel-wave trail

An independent check of the trail (maker != checker) read every number back
against its cited source and returned INTEGRATE-WITH-FIXES on six. All six are
prose in files this fork will publish; none changes a verdict word. Three of the
six re-imported a correction the governed record had already made - a superseded
commit message republished over the report that corrected it.

1. The q6_k op-level pairing was a cross-run one. 0.9796 is the gated one-binary
   run's q6_K median; 0.9990 / [0.9520, 1.0527] is the two-binary diagnostic's
   control. Each arm now carries its own control: 0.9796 against 1.0061,
   [0.9479, 1.0636]; the diagnostic's 0.9880 against 0.9990, [0.9520, 1.0527].
   Neither pairing separates, so NEUTRAL is unchanged. Fixed in four places.

2. "12 arm-launches" was the commit message's wrong arithmetic. The byte-identity
   gate is the serve phase: 6 launches x 3 prompts = 18 completions, 3 distinct
   shas. Fixed in three places.

3. F-13 credited the FP4 type with 13 correctness cases. That is the iq3_s count.
   The type's own receipt reads 10/10 MUL_MAT, and the r10 route adds 2
   MUL_MAT_ID: now "10 MUL_MAT correctness cases and 2 MUL_MAT_ID, 0 FAIL".

4. The every-width iq3_s loss was attributed to the wrong build. 616b877b8 is the
   >= 2 gate, whose own ladder reads n=4 x0.823 - confirmed by the x1.208 n=4
   recovery when the stock body came back. The x0.907 / x0.925 pair belongs to an
   intermediate build that never shipped. Both readings are now stated and
   attributed. A loss is still a loss; the number changes.

5. The canonical concat figure was labelled "position-balanced". The governed
   record corrected that on 2026-09-04: the view is position-1-EXCLUDED, a
   conservative residual. -11.4349% / -13.988 ms is unchanged.

6. The series counts (10 merges / 57 provenance / 415 patches) were stated as
   measured before-and-after without their basis. They were banked at 84ebe1269
   and re-held at a0cf8ef33; they were not re-measured at 131fad035. The basis is
   now on the page.

Docs only: no source, shader, CMake or build file is touched, and MANIFEST.md
stays generated.

Origin: lane-209 public trail (HQ seat-52, R9B), independent-check fixes
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED
